# Binary-serialised assets generated by the scene builders. "*.asset text eol=lf"
# above would rewrite CRLF bytes inside them at commit time and corrupt the
# file (Chapter0Terrain.asset failed to import for exactly this reason).
Assets/Chapter0/Terrain/*.asset binary
Assets/Chapter0/Textures/*.asset binary
Assets/Chapter1/Terrain/*.asset binary
Assets/New*Terrain.asset binary
